[Excel file will be created programmatically with the following sheets and columns:]

Sheet: UserModel
| Property            | Type      | Description |
|---------------------|-----------|-------------|
| id                  | ObjectID  | A unique ID generated by MongoDB for each user. |
| name                | String    | The full name of the user. |
| email               | String    | The email address of the user (unique). |
| password            | String    | The hashed password of the user. |
| phone               | String    | The phone number of the user. |
| province            | String    | The province where the user lives. |
| city                | String    | The city where the user lives. |
| gender              | String    | The gender of the user ('Nam', 'Nữ', 'Khác'). |
| dob                 | Date      | The date of birth of the user. |
| role                | String    | The role of the user ('guest', 'customer', 'employee', 'admin'). |
| preferences         | Object    | User preferences (genres: Array<String>, favoriteMovies: Array<ObjectID>). |
| resetPasswordToken  | String    | Token for password reset functionality. |
| resetPasswordExpire | Date      | Expiry date for the reset password token. |
| createdAt           | Date      | The timestamp when the user was created. |
| updatedAt           | Date      | The timestamp when the user was last updated. |

Sheet: AuthController
| Method            | Return Type | Description |
|-------------------|-------------|-------------|
| registerUser      | void        | Logic to register a new user. |
| loginUser         | void        | Logic to authenticate a user and return a JWT token. |
| getUserProfile    | void        | Get the profile information of the currently authenticated user. |
| updateUserProfile | void        | Update the profile information of the currently authenticated user. |
| forgotPassword    | void        | Send a password reset email to the user. |
| resetPassword     | void        | Reset the user's password using a valid reset token. |
| logoutUser        | void        | Log out the user (invalidate session on client side). |

Sheet: AuthMiddleware
| Method   | Return Type | Description |
|----------|-------------|-------------|
| protect  | void        | Middleware to verify JWT and authenticate user for protected routes. |
| admin    | void        | Middleware to check if the user has admin privileges. |
| employee | void        | Middleware to check if the user has employee or admin privileges. |

Sheet: AuthServiceFrontend
| Method            | Return Type | Description |
|-------------------|-------------|-------------|
| register          | Promise     | Send registration data to backend and receive user info/token. |
| login             | Promise     | Send login credentials to backend and receive user info/token. |
| logout            | Promise     | Log out the user (clear local storage, notify backend if needed). |
| updateUserProfile | Promise     | Send updated profile data to backend. |
| forgotPassword    | Promise     | Send email to backend to initiate password reset. |
| resetPassword     | Promise     | Send new password and token to backend to reset password. | 